     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p><span data-math=\"F = 2C + 30\"></span></p>\n<p><span data-math=\"F = 2\\left( {35} \\right) + 30\"></span></p>\n<p><span data-math=\"F = 70 + 30\"></span></p>\n<p><span data-math=\"100^\\circ {\\rm{F}}\"></span></p>"
